Allow validate-config to skip become on localhost.

service-config-validate writes its output on the deploy host with
become, so it fails with "sudo: a password is required" where that
user cannot escalate, as in a containerised deployer. Add
service_config_validate_output_become to make that become optional.

It defaults to true, so behaviour is unchanged, and is used only by the
two tasks delegated to localhost. It is set in the role defaults, so
the per-service config_validate.yml files need no changes.

